          "title": "You'll want to know: പ്രതിഷേധം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രതിഷേധം — pratiṣēdhaṁ — \"a protest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വില കൂടിയതിനെതിരെ നഗരത്തിൽ പ്രതിഷേധം നടന്നു. vila kūṭiyatinetire nagarattil pratiṣēdhaṁ naṭannu. There was a protest in the city against the price rise."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Against something: -ന് എതിരെ പ്രതിഷേധം (pratiṣēdhaṁ)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രതിഷേധം (pratiṣēdhaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit pratiṣedha, \"keeping back, warding off, prohibition\" (Monier-Williams). A protest pushes back against a decision."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
