          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഹർത്താൽ — harttāl — \"a general strike\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഹർത്താൽ കാരണം കടകൾ എല്ലാം അടഞ്ഞുകിടന്നു. harttāl kāraṇaṁ kaṭakaḷ ellāṁ aṭaññukiṭannu. Because of the general strike, all the shops stayed shut."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "On a ഹർത്താൽ (harttāl) day, shops close and buses stop."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഹർത്താൽ (harttāl) was borrowed from Hindustani haṛtāl, \"closing shops in mourning or protest\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit haṭṭa, \"a market\" (CDIAL 13944)."
            }
          ]
        },
